flowchart TB
  S([Start]) --> A[/Step 1: visitor types their email/]
  R1((1)) --> A
  A --> B{Email looks<br/>right?}
  B -->|No| B1[/That email does<br/>not look right/] --> R2((1))
  B -->|Yes| C[POST /api/auth/forgot-password]
  C --> D{Confirmed member,<br/>a minute passed?}
  D -->|Yes| D1[Make a reset code, store it<br/>hashed for 10 minutes,<br/>email it or print it]
  D -->|No| F[/The same answer either way: if that<br/>email has a pass, a code is on its way.<br/>Step 2: visitor types the code/]
  D1 --> F
  R3((2)) --> F
  F --> G[POST /api/auth/check-reset-code]
  G --> H{Right and<br/>in time?}
  H -->|No| H1[/That code is wrong<br/>or has run out/] --> R4((2))
  H -->|Yes| P((A))
